      "locale": "en_US",
      "tier": "tooltip",
      "text": "Senna sends forth the Black Mist, dealing (70/110/150/190/230 + (90% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage to the first enemy hit. After a 1 second delay the target and other nearby enemies are Rooted for 1.25/1.5/1.75/2/2.25 second(s).",
      "variant": null
    },
    {
